# That which is got or obtained; [[gain]]; [[profit]].
#* '''1882''', {{w|Charlotte Riddell}}, "Old Mrs Jones", in ''Weird Stories'', [https://books.google.com/books?id=0tb8AZyo4AcC&pg=PA135&dq=%22She+was+always+considering+how+to+increase+her+%22gettings,%22+but+she+never+gave+a+thought+as+to+how+she+might+save+them%22&hl=en&newbks=1&newbks_redir=0&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwi6l4nywOjnAhX5lHIEHazfA24Q6AEwAXoECAIQAg#v=onepage&q=%22She%20was%20always%20considering%20how%20to%20increase%20her%20%22gettings%2C%22%20but%20she%20never%20gave%20a%20thought%20as%20to%20how%20she%20might%20save%20them%22&f=false page 135]
#*: She was always considering how to increase her "'''gettings'''," but she never gave a thought as to how she might save them.

